{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"扇風機の風にあたりたーい!\n28℃の部屋で贅沢なこと言ってみたよ∩^ω^∩ふふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんカレンダーおまたせいたしました!２月ゆーて今日は７日だけれども。\nよかったら使ってあげて下さい(^O^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2012/02/06/2kare_2.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１月より２月のほうが予定たくさんで嬉しいな。\n予定かくペンが３色になってパワーアップしたしょ？\n握手会だって。テレビラジオ出演だって。ありがたい!\nいつもありがとうございますです。日々感謝ですね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、「２月」ってとこの横のスペースは、畠中画伯がステキな絵を\n書いてくださいました。拍手!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はあっしゅっしゅ（齋藤飛鳥chan）とお泊まりしたときのお話。\nあしゅが「お昼寝しすぎた寝れないー(>_<)」って言って\nひめたんが「お昼寝しすぎた寝れないー(>_<)」って言って\nこりゃ２人でオールするしか!ってなりました。\nあしゅ若いから(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやそれが本気でほんっきで寝れなくて!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電気切って、お布団いい感じにセットして、お部屋ぬくぬくして、\n寝るには最高の環境を作ったはずだったんぢゃけどねー。\n不思議なくらい眠れなかったの('・ω・`)何でだろー。\n...お昼寝しすぎたからだよね。ふふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局5:30とかに２人とも寝ちゃったんぢゃけどね、\nお互いビックリするくらい話が弾むのよ!\n６時間も話が途切れないって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(・o・ノ)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うんでねー、どんな会話をしたかというとねー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな会話したっけ。あれ？何話したっけあしゅー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってくらい他愛ない感じだった(`・ω・')!\nいいんです楽しいから♪\nあしゅのこと好きだったけどねー、\nもっと好きになった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅありがとーう。日の出を見る前に寝ちゃってごめんねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も乃木充(o>ω<o)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと前のコメんとも一緒にー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんブログだああ\nめっちゃ楽しみにしとったんよ？しってた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんまにー？\n知らんかった(・∀・)!嬉しい!ありがとうですー!!!\nひめたんがブログ書くの楽しみにしとったのは知っとったー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京の高校かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴんぽーん♪♪\n秋に説明会行ってからずっと憧れとった高校です(^^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新生活は東京だよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえすっ!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校入ってなんかしたいことあるん？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生になったらやりたい事とか目標とかある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステキな女子高生なる!\nお勉強も出来て、可愛いくて、乃木坂でも活躍してる子になれるって\nかっこいいぢゃないですかー(o>ω<o)!\n理想像であるメンバーには毎日会えちゃうから、頑張ろって思いますいつも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はね忘れない限りブログ開設から毎日メンバー全員の記事にコメしてるんだけど…\n知ってた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん毎回コメントチェックしとるくらいんよー∩^ω^∩♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはサッカーに興味あるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ルールとかよくわからんけど、スポーツ見るのは好き(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの、お散歩って大体何分くらいするんですか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４時間(・∀・)どや!\n５回お風呂に入って４時間お散歩する15歳、\n世界に２人もいないと思いますよー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここんとこ仕事忙しくて満足にコメ出来ないよ～( ；∀；)\n短めでもいいかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくださるだけで嬉しいですー。\n短いコメントも嬉しい。\n嬉しいっ(o>ω<o)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの好きな花はなんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さくら(。・ω・。)/\nお花はみんな好きだけど、さくらは本当に好き。\nユリとかも好き。\nやばい!春なくなっちゃだめだよ春!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きで好きで好きすぎるんですけど（笑）、ずっと好きでいてもいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きですねー(*/ω＼*)\nそんなひめきゅんのみなさんが、ひめたんも好きで好きで好きすぎるです。\nずっと好きでいてください!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうちょっとひき画像無いの？　家に飾りたいんだけど（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひき画...。\n携帯フォルダん中探せばあるかもだけど、\n恥ずかしいからやめておきます(*^^